# Python Flask App with Docker & PostgreSQL

A production-ready Python web application containerized with Docker and deployed to cloud.

## Tech Stack
- Python Flask
- PostgreSQL Database
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Kubernetes
- CI/CD with GitHub Actions
- Deployed on Railway

## Features
- Containerized with Docker
- Database connected with PostgreSQL
- Automated CI/CD pipeline
- Kubernetes deployment with auto-scaling
- Automated testing

